  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Publication Manual UNESCO Guide African Regional Youth Forum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote development of youth through its active participation in the protection and promotion of World Heritage with the view to contribute to the sense of belonging and ownership in protecting and transmitting the values of this African Heritage to young generations. proposal comes in the aftermath of the African Regional Youth Forum for the Africa portuguese speaking countries held at Ilha de mo&#xE7;ambique in May 2018. A manual shall be puduced and publishged for use and wider distribution</narrative>
  </description>
